{"type":"message","id":"b96c86e3","parentId":"62e15ad6","timestamp":"2026-02-27T04:43:56.045Z","message":{"role":"toolResult","toolCallId":"call_function_7szkz8ae5kip_1","toolName":"exec","content":[{"type":"text","text":"total 32\ndrwxrwxr-x 2 one one 4096 Feb 26 19:30 .\ndrwxrwxr-x 7 one one 4096 Feb 27 11:43 ..\n-rw-rw-r-- 1 one one 6488 Feb 27 10:48 fsrs.js\n-rw-rw-r-- 1 one one 2808 Feb 27 08:40 scheduler.js\n-rw-rw-r-- 1 one one 8503 Feb 27 08:39 storage.js"}],"details":{"status":"completed","exitCode":0,"durationMs":6,"aggregated":"total 32\ndrwxrwxr-x 2 one one 4096 Feb 26 19:30 .\ndrwxrwxr-x 7 one one 4096 Feb 27 11:43 ..\n-rw-rw-r-- 1 one one 6488 Feb 27 10:48 fsrs.js\n-rw-rw-r-- 1 one one 2808 Feb 27 08:40 scheduler.js\n-rw-rw-r-- 1 one one 8503 Feb 27 08:39 storage.js","cwd":"/home/one/.openclaw/agents/leader-agent"},"isError":false,"timestamp":1772167436043}}
{"type":"message","id":"540f2208","parentId":"b96c86e3","timestamp":"2026-02-27T04:43:58.309Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"让我检查 src/fsrs.js 的内容，确认它是如何使用 fsrs.js 库的。","thinkingSignature":"f66ceba3f33a8c5f6acdd165f2b52fb4e5eaea912d9395ab45c4a5fb318bdceb"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_function_62okaw9gcdg3_1","name":"read","arguments":{"file_path":"/home/one/.openclaw/skills/fsrs-memory/src/fsrs.js","limit":80}}],"api":"anthropic-messages","provider":"minimax-portal","model":"MiniMax-M2.5","usage":{"input":6755,"output":71,"cacheRead":7741,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":14567,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1772167436045}}
{"type":"message","id":"706f3f13","parentId":"540f2208","timestamp":"2026-02-27T04:43:58.328Z","message":{"role":"toolResult","toolCallId":"call_function_62okaw9gcdg3_1","toolName":"read","content":[{"type":"text","text":"// fsrs.js - Complete FSRS implementation using official fsrs.js library\nconst { FSRS, Card, Rating, State } = require('fsrs.js');\n\nconst fsrs = new FSRS();\n\nconst FSRSEngine = {\n  // Rating enum\n  Rating: {\n    Again: 1,\n    Hard: 2,\n    Good: 3,\n    Easy: 4\n  },\n  \n  // State enum\n  State: {\n    New: 0,\n    Learning: 1,\n    Review: 2,\n    Relearning: 3\n  },\n  \n  // Normalize state value to standard string\n  normalizeState(dbState, repetitions) {\n    // Handle undefined, null, or empty states\n    if (!dbState || dbState === '') {\n      return 'new';\n    }\n    \n    // Handle numeric states (convert to string)\n    const stateStr = String(dbState).trim();\n    \n    // Handle \"2.0\" or \"2\" which means Review\n    if (stateStr === '2.0' || stateStr === '2') {\n      return 'review';\n    }\n    \n    // Handle \"1.0\" or \"1\" which means Learning  \n    if (stateStr === '1.0' || stateStr === '1') {\n      return 'learning';\n    }\n    \n    // Handle \"3.0\" or \"3\" which means Relearning\n    if (stateStr === '3.0' || stateStr === '3') {\n      return 'relearning';\n    }\n    \n    // Handle \"0\" or \"0.0\" which means New\n    if (stateStr === '0' || stateStr === '0.0') {\n      return 'new';\n    }\n    \n    // Handle string states\n    const validStates = ['new', 'learning', 'review', 'relearning'];\n    if (validStates.includes(stateStr.toLowerCase())) {\n      return stateStr.toLowerCase();\n    }\n    \n    // Default: if repetitions is 0, treat as new\n    if (!repetitions || repetitions === 0) {\n      return 'new';\n    }\n    \n    // Otherwise treat as review\n    return 'review';\n  },\n  \n  // Convert database card to FSRS Card object\n  dbToCard(dbCard) {\n    const card = new Card();\n    const now = new Date();\n    \n    // Set initial values with defaults\n    card.ease_factor = dbCard.ease_factor || 2.5;\n    card.reps = dbCard.repetitions || 0;\n    card.lapses = dbCard.lapses || 0;\n    card.difficulty = dbCard.ease_factor || 2.5;\n    \n    // Normalize state before mapping\n    const normalizedState = this.normalizeState(dbCard.state, dbCard.repetitions);\n\n[136 more lines in file. Use offset=81 to continue.]"}],"isError":false,"timestamp":1772167438326}}
{"type":"message","id":"70b7fc6e","parentId":"706f3f13","timestamp":"2026-02-27T04:44:10.266Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"好的，现在我有了完整的信息来汇报 fsrs-refactor 任务的进度：\n\n## 汇报内容\n\n### 1. 设计阶段是否完成？选择了什么技术方案？\n- **设计阶段已完成** ✅\n- **技术方案**：使用 **fsrs.js v1.2.2** 官方 JavaScript 库（而非 ts-fsrs）\n- 原因：在 Node.js 环境下，fsrs.js 更直接，无需额外构建步骤\n\n### 2. 代码重构进展如何？\n- **server.js 已重构** ✅\n- 使用 `FSRSEngine` 封装层，调用官方 fsrs.js 库\n- 已实现：\n  - `dbToCard()` - 数据库卡片转换为 FSRS Card 对象\n  - `repeat()` - 执行复习计算\n  - `previewIntervals()` - 预览间隔\n- **src/fsrs.js** 已重构，使用官方 `fsrs.js` 库\n\n### 3. 遇到了什么问题？\n- 状态值不一致问题（如 \"2.0\" 字符串 vs 数字）- 已修复\n- 空状态处理 - 已修复\n\n### 4. 下一步计划\n- 根据 ARCHITECTURE.md，所有核心功能已经正常工作\n- API 测试全部通过（8/8）\n- 状态显示为 ✅ 所有核心功能正常工作","thinkingSignature":"113b25dc3b96055dfc6b736b5478d37982674fed791e3128fbb9cd00f92171b5"},{"type":"text","text":"根据文件分析，汇报 fsrs-refactor 任务进度如下：\n\n---\n\n## 1. 设计阶段是否完成？选择了什么技术方案？\n\n**✅ 设计阶段已完成**\n\n**技术方案**：采用 **fsrs.js v1.2.2** 官方 JavaScript 库\n\n| 项目 | 选择 | 说明 |\n|------|------|------|\n| 库 | fsrs.js v1.2.2 | 官方 JS 实现 |\n| 算法 | FSRS-6 | 21个参数 |\n| 环境 | Node.js | 原生支持 |\n\n**选型理由**：ts-fsrs 与 fsrs.js 内核相同但需要编译，在 Node.js 环境下 fsrs.js 更直接，无需额外构建步骤。\n\n---\n\n## 2. 代码重构进展如何？\n\n**✅ 代码重构已完成**\n\n- **web/server.js** 已重构：使用 `FSRSEngine` 封装层（`../src/fsrs`）\n- **src/fsrs.js** 已重构：基于官方 fsrs.js 库，封装了：\n  - `dbToCard()` - DB → FSRS Card 对象\n  - `repeat()` - 执行复习计算\n  - `previewIntervals()` - 预览间隔\n- **API 测试**：8 passed, 0 failed ✅\n- **package.json**：已安装 `fsrs.js: ^1.2.2` ✅\n\n---\n\n## 3. 遇到了什么问题？\n\n- **状态值不一致**：数据库中 \"2.0\" 字符串无法识别 → 已修复\n- **空状态处理**：NULL 或空状态 → 已修复为 'new'\n\n---\n\n## 4. 下一步计划\n\n根据 ARCHITECTURE.md，项目状态已标注为 **✅ 所有核心功能正常工作**（版本 1.1.0，2026-02-27）。\n\n暂无进一步重构计划，当前实现已是最终版本。"}],"api":"anthropic-messages","provider":"minimax-portal","model":"MiniMax-M2.5","usage":{"input":7449,"output":655,"cacheRead":7741,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":15845,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopRe